>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
*> Squarefree numbers up to 100; expect 61.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SQUAREFREE-NUMBERS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-COUNT   PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-P       PIC 9(9).
01 WS-N       PIC 9(9).
01 WS-D       PIC 9(9).
01 WS-Q       PIC 9(9).
01 WS-R       PIC 9(9).
01 WS-PRIME   PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 WS-FREE PIC 9.
01 WS-SQ PIC 9(9).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-P FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-P > 100
        MOVE 1 TO WS-FREE
        PERFORM VARYING WS-D FROM 2 BY 1 UNTIL WS-D * WS-D > WS-P
            COMPUTE WS-SQ = WS-D * WS-D
            DIVIDE WS-P BY WS-SQ GIVING WS-Q REMAINDER WS-R
            IF WS-R = 0 MOVE 0 TO WS-FREE END-IF
        END-PERFORM
        IF WS-FREE = 1 ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    DISPLAY WS-COUNT
    STOP RUN.
